  "duration_s": 108.566667,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "人一旦过了五十啊，你一定得服老。这一点要是不在意，后果真的不堪设想。很多人年纪大了，上个楼梯膝盖咔咔响，跳广场舞跳一会儿就跳不动了，以为这是正常现象。以为是年纪纪大，于是开始喝喝牛奶，吃钙片，实际上根本就不到内在其其。啊，这是因为缺缺少了一核心的营养养，就是骨胶原。骨胶原作为关节节面的重要的营养，随随着年龄的增长而加速流失，用的越多流失的越快，关你还不能自身合成。这个时候啊，你喝再多的牛奶骨头汤都没用，记住了补钙不补，骨胶原补再多都是浪费钱。所以啊朋友们人到中年，咱可千万不要盲目的去补钙思路，一定要对方法，也一定要找好。要知道钙针对的是硬骨骨胶原，照顾到的是软骨钙和骨胶原的关系啊，其实就像是钢筋和水泥一样，只有相互作用才能够牢牢的支撑。那有人就说了，这么好的东西是不是很贵？那么我再说一个颠覆大家认知的事情吧。其实骨胶原从工厂生产出来，它的成本并没有那么高。大家手里两百块钱的骨胶原和二十块钱的骨胶原，其实成分和含量都差不多。这些贵的骨胶原啊，其实都是贵在中间商和品牌溢价上。你看像我和我的家人一直在用的这一款诺特兰德的骨胶原。它的每一粒里面含有三百毫克的钙，一百毫克的骨胶原，同时添加了维生素d促进钙的吸收。这一瓶里面有足足的一百二十粒，够吃两个多月，现在刚好有优惠活动，拍二送一，算下来，每天也只需要几毛钱，关键是国货品牌品质有保障，老人小孩吃起来才放心，趁现在还没断货啊。点击视频的左下角千万别错过。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00001",
      "start_ms": 350,
      "end_ms": 1670,
      "text": "人一旦过了五十啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1670,
      "end_ms": 2670,
      "text": "你一定得服老。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2750,
      "end_ms": 3870,
      "text": "这一点要是不在意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4090,
      "end_ms": 5930,
      "text": "后果真的不堪设想。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6170,
      "end_ms": 7210,
      "text": "很多人年纪大了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7210,
      "end_ms": 8750,
      "text": "上个楼梯膝盖咔咔响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00007",
      "start_ms": 8890,
      "end_ms": 11030,
      "text": "跳广场舞跳一会儿就跳不动了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00008",
      "start_ms": 11210,
      "end_ms": 12590,
      "text": "以为这是正常现象。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00009",
      "start_ms": 12770,
      "end_ms": 14030,
      "text": "以为是年纪纪大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00010",
      "start_ms": 14090,
      "end_ms": 15590,
      "text": "于是开始喝喝牛奶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00011",
      "start_ms": 15590,
      "end_ms": 16410,
      "text": "吃钙片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00012",
      "start_ms": 16410,
      "end_ms": 18870,
      "text": "实际上根本就不到内在其其。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00013",
      "start_ms": 18870,
      "end_ms": 19070,
      "text": "啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00014",
      "start_ms": 19070,
      "end_ms": 21470,
      "text": "这是因为缺缺少了一核心的营养养，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00015",
      "start_ms": 21470,
      "end_ms": 22470,
      "text": "就是骨胶原。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00016",
      "start_ms": 22670,
      "end_ms": 25010,
      "text": "骨胶原作为关节节面的重要的营养，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00017",
      "start_ms": 25010,
      "end_ms": 27330,
      "text": "随随着年龄的增长而加速流失，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00018",
      "start_ms": 27690,
      "end_ms": 29610,
      "text": "用的越多流失的越快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00019",
      "start_ms": 29750,
      "end_ms": 31680,
      "text": "关你还不能自身合成。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00020",
      "start_ms": 31680,
      "end_ms": 32340,
      "text": "这个时候啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00021",
      "start_ms": 32340,
      "end_ms": 34900,
      "text": "你喝再多的牛奶骨头汤都没用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00022",
      "start_ms": 34900,
      "end_ms": 36400,
      "text": "记住了补钙不补，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00023",
      "start_ms": 36400,
      "end_ms": 39180,
      "text": "骨胶原补再多都是浪费钱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00024",
      "start_ms": 39460,
      "end_ms": 41260,
      "text": "所以啊朋友们人到中年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00025",
      "start_ms": 41400,
      "end_ms": 43680,
      "text": "咱可千万不要盲目的去补钙思路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00026",
      "start_ms": 43680,
      "end_ms": 45020,
      "text": "一定要对方法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00027",
      "start_ms": 45160,
      "end_ms": 46220,
      "text": "也一定要找好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00028",
      "start_ms": 46400,
      "end_ms": 48920,
      "text": "要知道钙针对的是硬骨骨胶原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00029",
      "start_ms": 49180,
      "end_ms": 52140,
      "text": "照顾到的是软骨钙和骨胶原的关系啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00030",
      "start_ms": 52240,
      "end_ms": 54420,
      "text": "其实就像是钢筋和水泥一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00031",
      "start_ms": 54600,
      "end_ms": 57280,
      "text": "只有相互作用才能够牢牢的支撑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00032",
      "start_ms": 57480,
      "end_ms": 58540,
      "text": "那有人就说了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00033",
      "start_ms": 58560,
      "end_ms": 60670,
      "text": "这么好的东西是不是很贵？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00034",
      "start_ms": 60910,
      "end_ms": 63470,
      "text": "那么我再说一个颠覆大家认知的事情吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00035",
      "start_ms": 63670,
      "end_ms": 65670,
      "text": "其实骨胶原从工厂生产出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00036",
      "start_ms": 65850,
      "end_ms": 67390,
      "text": "它的成本并没有那么高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00037",
      "start_ms": 67530,
      "end_ms": 70790,
      "text": "大家手里两百块钱的骨胶原和二十块钱的骨胶原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00038",
      "start_ms": 71030,
      "end_ms": 73365,
      "text": "其实成分和含量都差不多。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00039",
      "start_ms": 73680,
      "end_ms": 74780,
      "text": "这些贵的骨胶原啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00040",
      "start_ms": 74780,
      "end_ms": 77675,
      "text": "其实都是贵在中间商和品牌溢价上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00041",
      "start_ms": 78000,
      "end_ms": 81580,
      "text": "你看像我和我的家人一直在用的这一款诺特兰德的骨胶原。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00042",
      "start_ms": 81820,
      "end_ms": 84430,
      "text": "它的每一粒里面含有三百毫克的钙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00043",
      "start_ms": 84570,
      "end_ms": 85910,
      "text": "一百毫克的骨胶原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00044",
      "start_ms": 86210,
      "end_ms": 89035,
      "text": "同时添加了维生素d促进钙的吸收。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00045",
      "start_ms": 89320,
      "end_ms": 91240,
      "text": "这一瓶里面有足足的一百二十粒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00046",
      "start_ms": 91320,
      "end_ms": 92355,
      "text": "够吃两个多月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00047",
      "start_ms": 92620,
      "end_ms": 93940,
      "text": "现在刚好有优惠活动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00048",
      "start_ms": 94160,
      "end_ms": 95055,
      "text": "拍二送一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00049",
      "start_ms": 95400,
      "end_ms": 95800,
      "text": "算下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00050",
      "start_ms": 95800,
      "end_ms": 97540,
      "text": "每天也只需要几毛钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00051",
      "start_ms": 97800,
      "end_ms": 100040,
      "text": "关键是国货品牌品质有保障，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00052",
      "start_ms": 100200,
      "end_ms": 101940,
      "text": "老人小孩吃起来才放心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00053",
      "start_ms": 102120,
      "end_ms": 103260,
      "text": "趁现在还没断货啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_382dec811dde5c56_s00054",
      "start_ms": 103260,
      "end_ms": 106185,
      "text": "点击视频的左下角千万别错过。"
    }
  ],
